73:["$","ol","ol-8",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Client -> Server"}],": 发送 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Initial"}]," 包 (ClientHello)。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Server -> Client"}],": 服务器感觉有风险，不进行复杂的 TLS 运算，而是回复一个很小的",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"QUIC Retry 包"}],"，里面包含一个加密的",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"Token"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Client -> Server"}],": 客户端收到 Retry，必须重新发送 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Initial"}]," 包，但这次要带上刚才收到的",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"Token"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Server -> Client"}],": 服务器验证 Token 有效，确认客户端 IP 没问题，才开始正常的 1-RTT 握手流程（回复 Certificate 等）。"]}],"\n"]}]
